  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat offers a distinctive nautical theme, ideal for enhancing any boat, dock, or marina with a touch of seafaring style. It features an anchor design and can be customized with your boat name or location, making it a unique welcome mat for marine enthusiasts. Crafted for both indoor and outdoor use, it adds a personalized charm to your entryway.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with boat name, family name, or location for a unique welcome mat.</li>\n<li>Features vibrant maritime colors and anchor designs.</li>\n<li>Combines visual charm with comfort.</li>\n<li>Includes anti-slip pads to keep it securely in place.</li>\n<li>Suitable for high-traffic boat decks, marina entries, and coastal homes.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Repellent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Text input customization</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Anchor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester, Memory Sponge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Shake outdoors, vacuum, or wipe clean with a damp cloth</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This nautical doormat is perfect for welcoming guests to cabins, ships, yachts, fishing boats, or docks. Its durable design is also suitable for marine entries and coastal homes, bringing a personalized touch to various indoor and outdoor settings.</p>",
